      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REDBANK FLASH (1) finished well back at Taree Super Track last time when a 12 length eighth (31.23) but scored three back at this track (30.44). Has a good winning strike rate at this journey. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Should bounce back. MR. TURBO (6) boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten 0.8 lengths (19.83) behind Just Go Girl at Gunnedah. Has good early speed and can overcome the tricky draw. Bold showing expected. SWAN BAY MISS (2) stalked the pace from a low draw last start and fought on well to finish 6 lengths away in third (30.82) at this track in a Maiden over 515m. Safe beginner who has drawn to advantage. Hard to beat again. LAZY DYNAMITE (4) is a last-start placegetter worth considering.",
